WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:18.625 --> 00:00:20.458
Sometimes I like to pretend

00:00:20.458 --> 00:00:21.833
that I’m King James.

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:24.791
Blessed by the gods to choose my army,

00:00:25.083 --> 00:00:26.125
my Lord Commander 

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.416
and my home

00:00:28.041 --> 00:00:29.958
But alas, I am not

00:00:30.416 --> 00:00:32.458
I am Ser MarShon Brooks

00:00:32.666 --> 00:00:35.583
A journeyman sellsword, who, not long ago, 

00:00:35.583 --> 00:00:38.166
was fighting in the distant lands of Chai'Nos,

00:00:38.708 --> 00:00:40.000
spending years reassembling 

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.708
what remained of my shattered spirit 

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:43.375
only to land a seat

00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:45.375
on the dreary benches of Memphis.

00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:48.750
But fate is a curious thing

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:50.541
For yesterday,

00:00:50.541 --> 00:00:53.291
House Suns requested MY services and offered

00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:54.916
REAL assets in return

00:00:54.916 --> 00:00:57.916
Ser Trevor Ariza AND picks!

00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:59.958
Seems I shall finally prove to everyone

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.416
that I AM a knight worthy of minutes.

00:01:02.416 --> 00:01:05.416
And what I once feared was my twilight

00:01:05.416 --> 00:01:06.500
was in fact,

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.375
my dawn.

00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:12.125
Welcome to House Suns

00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:12.958
Thank you

00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:14.958
Ser MarShon Brooks at your service

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:16.833
Wait. MarShon Brooks?

00:01:16.833 --> 00:01:17.541
Yes...at your—

00:01:17.541 --> 00:01:19.000
OK, we traded for Dillon Brooks

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.666
You wha—oh, um…

00:01:20.666 --> 00:01:22.125
Dammit, they sent the wrong Br--

00:01:22.125 --> 00:01:23.791
House Grizzlies sent the wrong Brooks

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.083
Are you bloody serious?

00:01:26.291 --> 00:01:28.458
Oh, how the fickle tides of fate recede

00:01:28.458 --> 00:01:30.375
as quickly as they crash upon my shores.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:33.458
And though my sand castles may wither and wash

00:01:33.458 --> 00:01:34.916
the deft hands of hope must 

00:01:34.916 --> 00:01:36.375
always be there to rebuild them.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.583
I return to Memphis with fresh perspective,

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:40.958
renewed spirit

00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:48.833
Dearest Jennifer,

00:01:48.833 --> 00:01:50.333
I have received your raven,

00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:52.250
and I beseech you understand.

00:01:52.541 --> 00:01:53.875
I am trying

00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:55.083
I tryeth every day

00:01:55.083 --> 00:01:57.000
to bring you the ring you so desire…

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.083
Watch it. Hey, hey.

00:01:59.125 --> 00:02:01.666
Look who we blocked coming down the lane

00:02:02.875 --> 00:02:03.875
Well, look who it is!

00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:05.458
The Boogie Knight himself

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.250
They say our bigs can’t defend

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:09.250
Please! I’ve got a torn Achilles

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:10.291
Oh, OK

00:02:10.291 --> 00:02:11.791
Last I saw this lot, 

00:02:11.791 --> 00:02:13.291
you all were getting swept away

00:02:13.291 --> 00:02:16.291
faster than a harassment case at House Mavericks.

00:02:16.291 --> 00:02:17.375
Oh please, Boogie

00:02:17.375 --> 00:02:19.166
regale us with the tales of 

00:02:19.166 --> 00:02:22.500
your extensive tournament experience.

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:24.416
Better none than yours

00:02:25.125 --> 00:02:26.666
Don’t let him get in your head

00:02:26.666 --> 00:02:27.375
Aw...

00:02:27.375 --> 00:02:30.375
Good on you all for giving Jimmer another shot

00:02:30.375 --> 00:02:31.750
What? No. I’m Nik—

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:32.375
Wait

00:02:32.375 --> 00:02:34.958
I’m not going to fall for your hurtful tricks anymore! 

00:02:34.958 --> 00:02:36.791
You see, it seems the tables have turned! 

00:02:36.791 --> 00:02:39.750
Unlike you, I have two good Achilles AND friends

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:40.708
We got your back, Nik!

00:02:40.708 --> 00:02:42.583
How do you like my sauce now?

00:02:42.583 --> 00:02:43.083
Bitch

00:02:44.375 --> 00:02:46.166
What a fellowship you all have

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:49.125
Almost makes up for the lack of rings

00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:50.291
The Lord of Light...

00:02:50.291 --> 00:02:51.916
Hearted Locker Room Chemistry 

00:02:51.916 --> 00:02:53.500
smiles upon our Brotherhood.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.666
Who smiles upon you, Boogie?

00:02:55.666 --> 00:02:57.875
You’ve got no rings and no friends

00:02:57.875 --> 00:03:00.041
And which of those can you offer me?

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:02.208
Friends

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:05.583
I’d prefer rings

00:03:05.583 --> 00:03:07.166
Well then join us! And together

00:03:07.166 --> 00:03:09.333
we shall make it past the second round.

00:03:09.333 --> 00:03:09.833
Whoa, whoa 

00:03:09.833 --> 00:03:11.041
I don’t want this guy here

00:03:11.041 --> 00:03:12.708
He’s like, uh, mess with our flow

00:03:12.708 --> 00:03:13.416
you know what I mean?

00:03:13.416 --> 00:03:14.958
We have like, uh, good vibes and also

00:03:14.958 --> 00:03:16.833
like, um, we have same agent 

00:03:16.833 --> 00:03:18.666
and he says it might affect my minutes.

00:03:18.666 --> 00:03:19.333
Doesn’t matter

00:03:19.958 --> 00:03:21.750
It’s water under the Bay Bridge

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.666
I’m signing with House Warriors

00:03:23.666 --> 00:03:25.583
What? No, you can’t—

00:03:25.583 --> 00:03:26.625
They’re like an All-Star House

00:03:26.625 --> 00:03:27.583
That’s not fair!

00:03:27.583 --> 00:03:28.208
That’ll ruin the Realm!

00:03:28.333 --> 00:03:29.375
He’s full of it

00:03:29.416 --> 00:03:32.375
Everybody knows House Warriors is over the gold cap

00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:34.500
They can’t afford you!

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:35.916
No, it’s probably mid-level exception

00:03:35.916 --> 00:03:37.208
-Yeah, it’s a mid-level exception
-Yeah, you’ve got the mid-level taxpayers

00:03:37.375 --> 00:03:39.708
Oh right, right. The mid-level exception...

00:03:39.708 --> 00:03:41.208
I of course know what that is

00:03:41.208 --> 00:03:42.708
and fully understand it.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:45.000
My mind is a buzzin’

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.916
For I heard a hot take.

00:03:46.916 --> 00:03:49.125
Seems big Boogie Cousins

00:03:49.125 --> 00:03:51.000
Turned into a SNAKE!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.000
He rides to the Oak Lands

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.750
Where there’s rings all around.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:56.500
Give his headband a rebrand

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:59.291
As a ring-chaser’s crown.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.000
Oh yes! I love Four Bar Fridays!

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:03.083
Boogie

00:04:03.291 --> 00:04:03.875
Dame

00:04:04.708 --> 00:04:06.541
The only thing more hopeless than

00:04:06.541 --> 00:04:08.958
this brotherhood is your bard career.

00:04:08.958 --> 00:04:10.500
-Hey now
-Watch your tongue, Boogie!

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.333
You know, I expect you to be a bastard

00:04:12.333 --> 00:04:14.083
but a coward too?

00:04:14.333 --> 00:04:16.541
I’d rather die than share the court with Curry!

00:04:16.541 --> 00:04:17.000
Um…

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:18.541
No, sorry—I mean the good—

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:20.208
I mean Steph

00:04:20.208 --> 00:04:22.083
And the rest of those serpents.

00:04:22.083 --> 00:04:24.583
Dame, we’ve got no chance!

00:04:24.583 --> 00:04:26.125
We had no chance

00:04:26.125 --> 00:04:27.125
But we do now

00:04:27.666 --> 00:04:30.541
The Lord of Light-Hearted Chemistry is very powerful

00:04:30.541 --> 00:04:32.458
To the humble, He giveth…

00:04:32.458 --> 00:04:33.958
But to the greedy,

00:04:33.958 --> 00:04:35.208
He taketh away.

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:37.916
The Warriors’ defeat can only come from within

00:04:38.583 --> 00:04:41.333
No House can bear the likes of Draymond, KD

00:04:41.333 --> 00:04:42.291
AND Cousins.

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:45.000
Their golden cup runneth over with assholes

00:04:46.083 --> 00:04:46.916
Let him go

00:04:48.583 --> 00:04:50.416
Hope you enjoy the regular season

00:04:50.416 --> 00:04:51.708
you f--kin’ losers!

00:04:51.708 --> 00:04:54.375
I hope you get the f--king eighth seed

00:04:54.375 --> 00:04:57.375
so I can see your faces when we sweep you again!

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:00.041
I’ll crush you like I crush my Lord Commanders! 

00:05:00.041 --> 00:05:01.750
Does he know the way out of here? 

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:04.458
He’ll get himself ejected eventually

00:05:04.458 --> 00:05:06.250
My mind is a buzzin’

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:08.375
For I heard a hot take.

00:05:08.375 --> 00:05:10.458
Seems big Boogie Cousins

00:05:10.458 --> 00:05:12.666
Turned into a SNAKE!

00:05:12.666 --> 00:05:14.958
He rides to the Oak Lands

00:05:14.958 --> 00:05:16.916
Where there’s rings all around.

00:05:16.916 --> 00:05:19.125
Give his headband a rebrand

00:05:19.125 --> 00:05:21.666
As a ring-chaser’s crown

00:05:23.416 --> 00:05:25.375
A raven has brought us

00:05:25.375 --> 00:05:27.416
some news that is good.

00:05:27.416 --> 00:05:31.833
House Blazers acquired the knight Rodney Hood

00:05:31.833 --> 00:05:35.958
My Rip City brethren, rejoice and give cheer

00:05:35.958 --> 00:05:38.166
Except for Nik Stauskas,

00:05:38.166 --> 00:05:40.208
you’re now a Cavalier.

00:05:40.208 --> 00:05:40.875
Wait, what?

00:05:40.875 --> 00:05:42.500
Bye, Nik!

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.250
Good luck in Cleveland, Nik!

00:05:45.125 --> 00:05:48.500
If you enjoy Game of Zones, please consider subscribing

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:50.583
It lets us know you support the show,

00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:53.125
and we can notify you when new episodes come out.

00:05:53.125 --> 00:05:54.625
Have you subscribed, Markelle?

00:05:54.791 --> 00:05:55.708
No

00:05:55.708 --> 00:05:57.833
I tried to subscribe, but I missed

